{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7882eecca0e0a93aa2955aebcb33c0bac7ad99dd37d4dd2a41dcf98255a84aaf", "ja": "（地方公演から帰ってきて、数日経ったある日）", "zh": "（结束地方公演回来的数天后某日。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "e3dd960d07fe6c47cdc034898942b9e7af747255ebd0a44def493b53ee0273db", "ja": "すー……すー……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c236ef4c16e91dcebaa06da0f5e06c6c398fb0c495f06ca52cf11475e9e2522c", "ja": "ん？　百合子……寝てるのか。\nおーい、こんなところで寝たら風邪ひくぞ。", "zh": "嗯？百合子……在睡觉吗？\n喂──睡在这里会感冒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "385c86c62c8206ff5e50a6f0461d5ff228849f3d193eda31e4d6b5cf6ac2ab01", "ja": "ふにゃ……ん？　……ひゃうっ！？\n{$P$}さん、な、ななっ……！", "zh": "呼呀……嗯……呀呜！？\n{$P$}先生，怎、怎怎……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "b9cfd6984f9fb14229ae6f67139527209283c62aed42ca12aa87a0ca945351f3", "ja": "い、いきなり目の前に現れるなんてズルいです！\nつり橋効果とか、いろいろあるんですからっ！", "zh": "突、突然出现在别人眼前太犯规了！\n这会产生很多后遗症，比如吊桥效应之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7c30eb44af5b10d850302b1c79a93570d014225321c2d6b59df34aa50250ef6d", "ja": "ごめんごめん、そんなつもりはなかったんだ。\n……ただ、いきなり現れてもいないぞ？", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，我不是故意的。\n……不过，我并不是突然出现的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "1621d4a2d53d24f765f1c7e3c07693da59fe28441989d5f979112dfe700f9a44", "ja": "え？　あれ？　……あっ。\n私、寝ちゃってたんだ……。ご、ごめんなさいっ。", "zh": "咦？奇怪……\n啊，我睡着了啊……对、对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7c56a9dd1b90abc818a4d1400ef68dec8e82a91461cbac4eef3d835c3e4080ad", "ja": "いや、いいんだけど。でも居眠りなんて珍しいな。\n疲れてるのか？", "zh": "不会，没关系，但真难得你会打瞌睡。\n你很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "06991800c78e146abd4d51c2eefd58b85165a86ca55522197781a41e6354824a", "ja": "あ、えっと、その……。\n実は昨日、ちょっと夜更かししちゃって。", "zh": "啊，呃，那个……\n其实我昨天熬了一下夜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "20f3068036bf27a0a8d857e72302d60e5ab89f6764226c539f2733a0b0c32600", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんとゲームしてたんです。うう、寝る前に\n新しいダンジョンをのぞいたのが失敗でした……。", "zh": "我是跟小杏一起玩游戏。\n呜呜，真不该在睡觉前去看新开放的迷宫一眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2d492c88d99986b7ac09ffabb4e582e34e5291cb9d0c27f80eecf95471536514", "ja": "それはダメなやつだな……。ま、ゲームをするのは\nいいけど、やりすぎには気をつけるんだぞ。", "zh": "那可是大忌啊……要玩游戏是可以，\n但小心不要玩过头喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "49eb67d5c0aeddc25c64cc5d0e5a22ef7bfe89f98b75ac1b94620f42193b6d16", "ja": "は、はい、ごめんなさい……！", "zh": "好、好的，对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "4b4c959090ce702ddb767e1a4a6ab98c21cb3e2ebb04f26536779c14e286a760", "ja": "ところで……。あの～、{$P$}さん？\nよかったら、その……、やってみませんか？", "zh": "话说回来……那个～{$P$}先生，\n要是方便的话，你……要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "747c4ae37ca3368aef39e6507b1862515baa4078d525e415ae49264aafe6591c", "ja": "えっ。何を？", "zh": "咦？试什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "29559ae87f6b8f7ca5e63b5cfc97046e5b8a56a3c05a3fe1f5de5cd388cf5d89", "ja": "もちろん、今私たちが遊んでるゲームです！\nきっと楽しいですよ！", "zh": "当然是我们正在玩的游戏！\n一定会很好玩喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "59799e4c1c2c82ee9e8e9ccd2b0c064d9ec3ba7ca925cf6144e1185226935f02", "ja": "私たちのいるサーバは、人も多くて賑やかなんです。\nお仕事の参考になることも、ある……かもしれません！", "zh": "我们所在的伺服器人很多、很热闹，\n游戏过程对工作也会有帮助……应该吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "126f688d04534e684c91c4e53bec973c3e30e3ae848303422432c47e0ff27c14", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら、お仕事の\n時みたいで、私たちも……うれしいかな、なんて……。", "zh": "如果跟{$P$}先生一起玩，\n就跟工作时很像，我们也会……觉得很高兴啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "c74c5f646b3d735f57abc597224ee699f6e1f5a64ddd18b68f3e171e6fb321ee", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}さん。\n一緒に蒼龍エアリアルに乗って、風になりませんか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么样呢？\n要不要一起骑乘苍龙艾瑞欧，化作一道风呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f9d9ec7b6029e9f11b3ea7c454bb3ee3dee89380177082bd09876e824ad64c27", "ja": "そ、そうか。うん、まあ……。\nちょっとくらいなら、やってもいいかな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。嗯，这……\n如果只玩一下子，应该也可以？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "ac8d3fb557585894b5559252858cd016f336b06e416cf62ae7b3b751b6f30faf", "ja": "本当ですか？　やったー！\n約束ですからね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "真的吗？太好了──！\n我们说好啰，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "76ddf76d1d120d8b53f48bd61d8fdba1e84acacd637b8f7af26b782c57463ff6", "ja": "そうだ、杏奈ちゃんにも教えてあげなくちゃ！\nあ、その前に！　ハンドルネームは……どんな……？", "zh": "对了，也要告诉小杏才行！\n啊，在那之前！昵称要用……什么样的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a3cf9ceaf5bcf4c7919fc65983e88d13407081609f1c6df47bc8bbf79ed8bdb0", "ja": "（あふれる期待に瞳を輝かせている。\n百合子の新しい冒険の扉を開いてしまったらしい）", "zh": "（百合子的双眼满溢着期待。\n我似乎不小心为她打开了新的冒险之门。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0113_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bce8e50f839617fca99575c46b9c11d927e20fd4bdd35b71b592d326c046bd0c", "ja": "（これから先、どんな成長を見せてくれるのか……\nちょっとゲームの中でも、見守ってみるか！）", "zh": "（今后她会展现出怎样的成长……\n就让我也在游戏里关注一下吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
